# API contract

This package is an integration layer over `proofage/php-sdk`; the resources, enums, exceptions
and signing are the SDK's. The exact request/response shape of every `ProofAge` facade /
`ProofAgeClient` method is in:

- `vendor/proofage/php-sdk/AGENTS.md` — endpoint-by-endpoint request/response/error contract.
- `vendor/proofage/php-sdk/resources/openapi.json` — machine-readable OpenAPI 3.1.
- `@param` / `@return` array shapes on `ProofAge\Sdk\Resources\*` (the classes under
  `src/Resources/` here are empty subclasses kept for backwards compatibility).

`AGENTS.md` in this repo documents only what the package adds: provider, facade, middleware,
artisan command, config resolution. Contract changes go to the SDK first; the drift guard
(`tests/ApiContractTest.php` against the spec) lives there.
